  << /ActualText (Panel design refers to the systematic layout and visual design of modular\054 flat or structured panels\024often used in displays\054 control interfaces\054 exhibition boards\054 packaging inserts\054 signage\054 and digital dashboards\056 It focuses on organizing information\054 graphics\054 and functional elements in a clear\054 balanced\054 and user\055friendly way within a fixed panel area\056 The goal is to improve readability\054 strengthen visual hierarchy\054 maintain brand consistency\054 and support both aesthetic expression and practical use\056)
